WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.650
During the first half of the 21st century,

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:10.030
a revolutionary energy source called "Nectoribium" was discovered

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.380
which in turn shook the world's structure.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.660
The great Zogilia, who had a history of excavation,

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.700
conquered nearby countries in order to increase their power.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.670
In response to this, some countries formed the "Confederate Treaty of Liberty Alliance"

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.510
and fought against Zogilia as the world's final hope.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.020
The Alliance was at a severe disadvantage

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.450
and sought a new type of combat system.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.310
This was the Coupling System.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:53.650
But at the time, the system was flawed and suffered numerous setbacks.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.780
As a result, the project was halted.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.820
However, two years ago during the Third Far East War,

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.540
the project was secretly resumed.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.290
After rectifying the flaws, the—

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.760
What...

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:08.750
Aoba-san?

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.690
Wake up!

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.880
Spread your wings

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:28.510
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:31.800
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:37.180
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:46.440
That world you see before your eyes

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:52.030
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.500
The pain of loss isn't something

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.460
You want to get used to, and yet

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:04.420
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:11.390
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:13.220
Can't go back

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.640
Want to go home

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.980
The two of them back-to-back

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.020
Break through

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:24.770
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:28.110
Like painting over a colorless world

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:30.820
Let this sympathy reach

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:37.080
Let's build the future that we envision

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.290
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:45.090
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.610
We have reached the first way-point, FL No. 350.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:56.480
Re-configuring engines, preparing for maximum thrust.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.530
He's an expert when it comes to sleeping during lessons.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.490
Captain! That's not nice.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.950
But I'm worried about Mayu-chan.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.010
The Coupling System is highly classified information.

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.720
Whether he's a time traveler from the past

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:15.420
or an unregistered civilian,
he must be kept under constant surveillance.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:20.470
Don't worry, Corporal Nasu is the best when it comes to self-defense.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.720
But…

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.050
Captain.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.890
I understand, Lieutenant Commander Lene.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.140
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! Um...

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.940
My name's Nasu Mayuka.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:33.100
I figured I could teach you some of the basics
since you told me you didn't know anything.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.980
But I'm also very busy since I'm the one in charge of the Coupling System.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.320
Mayuka-chan, are you a specialist?

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.840
Oh, no.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.700
Actually, I'm just an assistant to the technical officer, Elvira-san.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.080
I'm sorry. I was tired.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:51.790
Trying to operate a robot while
running for my life was very difficult.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.600
It's called a Valiancer.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.540
That's right. A Valiancer.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.380
But there shouldn't have been any
Valiancer units around 70 years ago.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.320
Yeah, it came from the future. That's what Hina said.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.260
Hina?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:07.180
My classmate, Yumihara Hina.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:11.600
She came from the future to save me and brought me to this time period.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.900
I wonder what happened to her after that?

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:19.820
If your story's true...

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:21.030
Then what?

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.560
The most likely explanation would be...

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.120
that it was a dream.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.760
You don't believe me at all.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.370
Oh, the lift's here.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.910
This way, please.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:39.500
This is Luxon, the Valiancer you were piloting.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.510
Luxon?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:51.430
<i>I was definitely in there with Hina just recently.</i>

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.560
<i>Valiancer and war.</i>

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>I really did come to the future.</i>

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:03.150
Weird. It looks so different from before.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:07.370
That's because it's a prototype. We're continually improving it.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.660
Elvida-san is reprogramming it to match your data, Aoba-san.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.370
My... data?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:19.540
A Valiancer must be calibrated for the
pilot in order for a Coupling to succeed.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.340
The next time you pilot it,
it'll be even better than before.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.090
Huh? I have to pilot it again?

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.550
You're not?

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:32.060
Then why did the captain have it modified?

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.520
I... have to fight again.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.020
What're you doing?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.650
<i>It's him.</i>

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.460
No more guns please, Dio.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.480
I told you not to address me like that.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:48.240
Corporal Nasu. This area of the ship is classified by the joint headquarters.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:52.400
This area is off-limits to civilians.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:57.160
Um, but Elvida-san ordered me to show him around.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.890
Mayuka-chan did nothing wrong.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.790
Why don't you just tell me?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:04.210
You are not a soldier. I won't force civilians to obey military rules.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.340
Did the army also teach you to yell at women?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.050
Corporal Nasu is a soldier as well.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.930
Excuse me. Both of you just—

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.220
The battle deployment alarm.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.140
We're in trouble.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:16.640
Hey!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.150
I'm sorry, Aoba-san. Please return to your room.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.020
Wait, Mayuka-chan!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:27.610
Where is my room?

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.490
The Valiancers have passed the third warning perimeter.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.320
Two more minutes before they make contact.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.030
Engines need five more minutes for a crash drive.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.250
We'll need to hold them back for at least three minutes.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.790
Everyone, prepare for battle.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:38.970
Sorry I'm late.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.380
I'm done here. Help me with the reprogramming.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.290
Understood.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:47.510
All Valiancer units are to defend the ship until it is ready to dive.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.730
Roger.

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:53.350
Three enemy units. The same type as before.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.720
There's less of them this time.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.120
This is going to be good.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.520
Valiancer team, launching.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.530
All units have been launched.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.450
Okay, prepare for a crash dive!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.060
Yes, sir!

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.160
So... what are you doing here?

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.370
Incredible.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.170
No previous data on their flagship.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.540
Is it also a new-type?

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.550
It kinda looks like a white swan.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.050
The enemy ship's engine is increasing in output.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.880
Are they planning to outrun us?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.380
Enemy units spotted.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:35.220
Don't get hit before the real show begins.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.140
Our goal is to hold them off. Don't overdo it!

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.020
Valiancer team has engaged the enemy.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.600
Activating Nectar shield.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.200
Commander, it's seven sequences to the surface.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.740
Dio, the one with the red crest is yours.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.830
Roger that.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.580
Is that all you've got?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.340
Seems like we've overestimated you.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.290
You're gonna send me to sleep!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.090
The white new-type hasn't appeared yet.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.130
It has begun.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:16.090
Commander, we're almost ready for a crash dive.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.260
Valiancer team, return immediately!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.310
All units, please return.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.180
We're getting out of here.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:22.140
Roger that.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.190
I've been waiting for this!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.330
"Everything went as planned," huh?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.320
We should return, too.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:33.990
Damn.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.030
I don't like this.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.990
Enemy Valiancers are falling back.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.620
Commander, we're ready to crash dive.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:44.680
Valiancer units are returning at our 10 o'clock.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.710
Cygnus, maximum speed—

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.920
Warning! Incoming high energy source at 6 o'clock.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:49.880
Evasive!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.210
Changing course.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.890
The rear water tank has been damaged by a Nectar Cannon.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.880
A Nectar Cannon?

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:05.460
There should be no such weapon in this area.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.810
I'm bringing an image up now.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.110
A Valiancer?

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.730
That mecha is...

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.230
Don't tell me it's Zogilia's...

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.360
Alfried Gallant.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:18.070
So <i>his</i> team was the enemy tailing us.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.580
Our left engine has been heavily damaged.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.040
This is the Nectar Rifle.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.790
I can't believe they managed to
create a portable Nectar Cannon

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.800
for a Valiancer unit that has already been deployed.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.380
Two consecutive shots is its limit.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:40.010
The star of Zogilia's army came bearing new weaponry.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.720
We really are unfortunate.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:44.310
Maximum speed unattainable! We can't lose him!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.100
Valiancer team, begin counterattack.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.810
We're going for it now!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.320
What the...?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.940
They didn't fall back?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.700
Good job on the diversion, Bizon.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.040
Took some effort, but that's to be expected.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.200
The real battle starts now. Let's go!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:04.870
Yes, sir!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.200
At this rate, Cygnus will be destroyed.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.960
We'll deal with those three.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.850
Dio, can I count on you to defeat Alfried?

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.020
Of course.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.890
Is that it?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.370
At that speed, it doesn't appear to have transformed.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.430
How convenient.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:28.730
Is he trying to run away?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:30.730
Hurry up!

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:33.190
If you're not quick enough, we'll all be dead!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.860
We got shot again?

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.170
Yeah.

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.660
We <i>are</i> in the middle of a battlefield, after all.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:39.910
Battlefield?

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:45.140
And this time the enemy is even stronger. You may have to fight again.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.870
Can you swim?

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.240
You know we're flying above the ocean, right?

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.330
You may live a little bit longer if you can.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.050
Don-san, Aoba-kun, I need to talk to you guys for a moment.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.500
Oh, Captain.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.840
Me, too?

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.600
Enemy is closing in on the final warning line.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.100
Be careful, Dio.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.180
Just a bit more.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:10.980
There he is.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.700
Why isn't he fighting back?

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.570
The fun begins now.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.250
It was a trap?

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.040
This weapon is useless in close combat.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.670
Back me up while it's recharging.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.130
Capture the new mecha.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:40.720
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.520
Close combat?

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.650
Die, enemy of Zogilia!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.160
That's just like Hina.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:06.120
She isn't called Lieutenant Commander
Ryazan's best pupil for nothing.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.420
This is Bradyon. I'm surrounded by three enemy units.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:35.190
Is that all you've got, Alliance new-type? I was expecting more.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.310
This guy is strong.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.360
Damn it. I'm surrounded, too!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.570
The enemy's goal is capturing Bradyon.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.650
What about our backup weapons?

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.850
They're too far away from the ship.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:46.870
Dio...

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:51.160
Have we completely lost to Alfried's trick?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.710
All set. Luxon is ready to launch anytime.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.670
What? Luxon?

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:00.380
Aoba-san!

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.090
That guy...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:12.060
I'm truly sorry that I have to rely on you, a civilian, once again.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:19.250
However, in such a desperate situation,
I have no other choice but to ask for your help.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:23.500
It's fine. I don't want to die like this, either.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.650
Let me fight!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.800
<i>But it's still scary.</i>

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:30.700
Are you ready for launch?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.450
Yes!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:36.330
You've already shared Dio's
knowledge from the previous Coupling

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.870
so you should have no problems flying.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.380
Prepare for launch!

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:43.130
Anyway, fly towards the red mecha.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.380
We'll tell you when to engage Coupling.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:49.260
The timing window is small in aerial battles.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.180
Please be careful, Aoba-san.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.720
If you can't handle it, you should turn back now.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:55.900
Who in the world would give up?

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:57.440
What's with this guy?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.650
Luxon, let's go.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.940
Lieutenant Colonel, the other new mecha is approaching.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.260
I've got him.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:10.820
Hina,

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.450
you heard him.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.440
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.410
Yes, sir.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:18.420
Entering the Coupling region. ETA 15 seconds.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.170
In the end, it's with him again.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:24.420
What?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.090
Are you running away?

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.310
Let's do it, Dio!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.600
Luxon is within range of the Seventh Code.

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.060
Start the Proposing!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.440
Connect with Dio!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.610
Accept!

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:48.360
Approach Ring activated.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.820
Start Esteftguide Navigation

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:54.450
Approach Ring assigned. Beginning linkage.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.130
Forceveil is opening.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:01.120
Emphater level increasing. Start Consolation.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.830
Commencing Esthev navigation guide.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.220
Coupling complete!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.140
They've finished Coupling?

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:13.850
Bizon, the enemy!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.180
Leave it to the Lieutenant Colonel.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.310
This is...

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.520
What?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.270
That's...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.980
I'll leave here to you.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.980
Where is "here"?

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:31.780
<i>This again?</i>

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.530
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.290
This is Dio's?

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.920
Disappear, enemy of Zogilia!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.220
If he can last for at least a minute, I'll...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.620
I see.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.760
Their speed is completely different than before.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:58.470
But speed is merely a number.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.440
You thought it'd hit?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.980
He was able to dodge it visually?

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.190
Impossible.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.320
Fall!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.030
Did I miscalculate?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.700
Lieutenant Colonel!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.040
I'm sorry, Passo. I'll be back on my feet.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:19.740
Roger that.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:21.080
I won't let you get away!

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:24.370
Lieutenant Colonel?

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:30.920
This guy...!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.550
Dio is counting on me to handle this.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.260
Get out of the way!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:42.680
Alfried of Zogilia's Valiancer is being driven into a corner.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.900
Luxon is also putting up a good fight.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.400
Of course. It <i>is</i> a Coupling mecha.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:56.320
The Coupling System allows both pilots to
share all of their potential with each other.

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:04.100
The linkage connects the minds and the senses of each pilot to the other.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.880
By doing this, the Valiancers' power is drastically increased.

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:15.300
Zogilia pilots are now facing a Valiancer exceeding conventional limits.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.010
What overwhelming speed and power.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.180
We have underestimated the Alliance's Valiancer technology.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.310
Or is it...?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.640
Lieutenant Colonel, I'll stop him for you.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.980
Stop. Do not engage!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.270
What?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.570
There's no way you can hit me!

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:39.570
Passo!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.540
At least target the cockpit.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.000
I'm going to backup the Lieutenant Colonel.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:49.920
Understood.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.710
Alright!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.090
What kind of mobility is that?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.090
I'm used to it so far.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:58.510
I don't see Dio's hands anymore, but...

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.640
What kind of move was that?

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.230
Don't make fun of me!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.020
What?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.990
I did it!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.420
The enemy's pilot...

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:46.180
Hina?

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.150
Hina? I remember...

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.200
Emphater levels decreasing!

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:54.110
That's dangerous. Separate them immediately!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.980
I'm working on it.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.860
The link has been forcefully broken!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.290
Why?

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.950
Luxon has opened the cockpit.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:03.530
What?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.540
You bastard! What the hell do you think you're doing in the middle of battle?!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.090
It's Hina. Hina is there!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.490
That bastard.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.290
Dio, prepare yourself.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.250
No!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.050
Forced Decoupling.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.720
Bradyon's performance is dropping.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.420
Dio, get a hold of yourself!

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:31.960
U-Understood.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.660
Wake up, Hina!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.530
Sympathy towards the enemy.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.410
I'm not sure about that.

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:49.890
Maybe he doesn't see that person as an enemy.

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:03.930
An Alliance pilot.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.640
Hina! Are you awake?! You okay?!

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.350
How do you know my name?

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.940
It's me! Watase Aoba!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:12.860
Aoba?

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:16.010
Yes, Aoba! I'm coming over.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.610
What is he doing?

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.570
Is he trying to capture her?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.030
You bastard! Stay away from Hina!

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.160
Bizon!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.630
Just in time.

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:38.500
Get out of the way!

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.450
Aoba, get back inside your mecha!

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.920
Lee-san? But, Hina..

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.760
I don't care who it is. Bring them too, if you have to!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.990
Understood.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.650
Don't come near me.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.350
You are an enemy of Zogilia!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.430
Hold on!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.940
Battle Priority System has been activated.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.240
Hina!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.650
Hina, are you okay?

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:08.540
Bizon!

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:09.700
Let's retreat.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.170
Lee!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.010
Lee-san...

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.340
Captain Conrad, please reply!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.340
The enemy?

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.300
They're also at their limits.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.550
All units retreat.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.060
Lasha, understood.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.350
Tarjim, understood.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:33.810
Bizon, got Fortuna.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.020
You have failed, Lieutenant Colonel.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.770
I understand, Special Service Agent.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:44.530
<i>There shall be no more failures, Alfried Gallant.</i>

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.620
First Lieutenant Duran, what's the condition of the Beryl?

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:59.300
The left arm was destroyed,
however, the cockpit is undamaged.

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:02.170
I'll open the second hatch now. Return immediately.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:02.840
Hina was right there.
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:05.260
<i>Can you confirm Luxon's condition?</i>

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:06.810
<i>I cannot.</i>

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:11.550
He said Hina?

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:20.800
With my heart, I call out

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:25.180
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:29.690
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:34.320
Just for now, please

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:38.490
I know you

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:42.990
I'm searching for you

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:45.450
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:45.450 --> 00:22:52.090
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:52.090 --> 00:23:00.640
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:05.220
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:05.220 --> 00:23:09.770
and the times I have wondered

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:14.020
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.280
I want to save you,

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:18.360
I want to protect you

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:22.740
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:25.620
Wait for me

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.370
The love we'll surely find

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:35.170
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:37.820 --> 00:23:40.210
Next episode on Buddy Complex:

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:41.840
"The Time for Resolve."
